CK-ERP is an open source accounting/ERP/CRM system that runs on top of
eGroupWare / osCommerce / Xaraya / Horde / TikiWiki / phpBB.  It
comprises 20 modules - Administration, i18n, Contact Management,
Customer Relationship, Customer Self Service, Vendor Relationship,
Ledger, Bank Reconciliation, Inventory, Service, AP, AR, PO, SO,
Quotation, POS for Cashier, POS for Manager, HR, Staff Self Service and
Payroll.  Operating platform can either be LAMP or LAPP.  It provides
accounting and back office functionalities to SMEs and utilizes the
underlying middleware to administer accounts/groups.  Please report
error and suggestion to the discussion group / mailing list,
CK-ERP-en(at)googlegroups.com or CK-ERP-zh_CN(at)googlegroups.com .
General history and expected development is available at the discussion
group's Archive.

